Attribution and licensing
-------------------------

The R function conindex() implements the concentration index methods
described by Owen O'Donnell, Stephen O'Neill, Tom Van Ourti, and
Brendan Walsh (2016). The R code was written from the methods and
formulas published in their article.

The polecon package is distributed under the GNU General Public
License, version 3 (GPL-3).

Reference:
O'Donnell, O., O'Neill, S., Van Ourti, T. and Walsh, B. (2016).
Conindex: Estimation of concentration indices. The Stata Journal,
16(1), 112-138. doi:10.1177/1536867X1601600112.
